From Coq Require Import ZArith List.
From compcert Require Import Integers AST Ctypes Values Memory Events Clight ClightBigstep.
Require Import WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_get_owned.
Require Import WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_get_owned_numeric.
Set Printing Width 120.
Set Printing Depth 100000.
Set Default Timeout 60.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_get_owned.scalar_get_owned_run_eq.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_get_owned.scalar_get_owned_return.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_get_owned.scalar_get_owned_regions.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_get_owned.eval_scalar_get_b32_owned.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_get_owned_numeric.scalar_get_owned_storage.
Check WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_get_owned_numeric.eval_scalar_get_b32_numeric_owned.
Print WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_get_owned.scalar_get_owned_regs.
Print WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_get_owned.scalar_get_owned_run.
Print WriterC.jet_secp_scalar_get_owned.scalar_get_owned_state.
